lens_profiles.invalid = Fili ha tauhiʻanga Lensfun v1/v2 XML ʻoku totonu (ʻo aʻu ki he 8 MiB) mo e fakamatala ʻo e meʻafaitā pe lenisi ʻoku poupouʻi.
