lens_profiles.no_calibration = ʻOku ʻikai ha fua fakatonutonu ʻoku feʻunga mo e ngaahi fokotuʻutuʻu ni. Vakaiʻi e lōloa fōkasi mo e fua kolope ʻo e meʻafaitā; ʻoku kei lava ʻa e fakatonutonu nima.
lens_profiles.import = Hū mai ʻa e Lensfun XML…
lens_profiles.imported = Kuo hū mai e tauhiʻanga Lensfun ki he taimi ngāue ni. Fili ha profil pe fakafehoanaki mo e fakamatala ʻo e tā.
