lens_profiles.distance = Mamaʻo fōkasi (0 = ʻikai ʻilo)
lens_profiles.vignette = Fakaʻuliʻuli ngataʻanga kuo fua
lens_profiles.color_context = ʻOku fiemaʻu ʻe he fakaʻuliʻuli ngataʻanga kuo fua ʻa e profil sRGB ʻoku ʻi loto. Liliu ki he sRGB ke tauhi e anga hā, pea toe fakaava ʻa e Fakatonutonu Lenisi. Kapau ʻoku ʻosi sRGB ʻa e ngaahi pikisela ka ʻikai ha fakaʻilonga, feʻunga pē hono vaheʻi ki ai ʻa e profil sRGB. ʻOku kei lava ʻa e fakatonutonu ʻo e fuo mo e ngaahi ngataʻanga lanu.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = ʻOku ʻikai ha fua fakaʻuliʻuli ngataʻanga ʻoku feʻunga mo e aperture mo e mamaʻo fōkasi. Fakakau e ngaahi mahuʻinga kuo fua ke fakamoʻui; ʻoku ʻuhinga ʻa e 1000 m ki he fōkasi mamaʻo ʻi he ngaahi profil Lensfun lahi.
lens_profiles.note = ʻOku fakahoko e fakatonutonu kuo fua kimuʻa ʻi he ngaahi meʻangāue nima. Ngāueʻaki e ʻuluaki ʻata kakato; toki kolope kimui. Tauhi ha fokotuʻunga filter ʻi he PSD/PSB ke kei lava ʻo fakatonutonu e fua.
lens_profiles.automatic = Fakafehoanaki mo e fakamatala ʻo e tā
